# OSS-AgentOS environment template
#
# Level 0 requires no environment variables and no secrets: the CLI runs
# entirely offline. Copy this file to .env for local overrides in later
# levels; real secrets must never be committed (see .gitignore).
#
# Future levels will add AGENTOS_* variables here as the code that reads
# them is implemented. The future LLM runtime configuration (mode, endpoint,
# model, credentials) is specified in docs/LLM_RUNTIME_CONTRACT.md and is
# NOT active in Level 0.
